# AIC8800D80 USB firmware manifest (cubie-a7a-aic8800-usb).
#
# File names and SHA256 only. No firmware file is part of this package, the
# Cubie A7A image or any repository; nothing downloads it. A user who wants
# Wi-Fi/Bluetooth obtains the files and installs them with
#   cubie-a7a-wifi-firmware install <directory-or-.deb>
# which copies only the files below, and only if every one it finds matches.
# Licence: unclear (see /usr/share/cubie-a7a/WIFI-FIRMWARE.md).
#
# Reference copy (the only public source known):
#   package     aic8800-firmware 5.0+git20260123.5f7be68d-9 (Radxa, Debian, Architecture: all)
#   release     https://github.com/radxa-pkg/aic8800/releases/tag/5.0%2Bgit20260123.5f7be68d-9
#   deb sha256  1dbc31172830232bfdc53d6416fc73d9a2c80fe862545c51a1398f671b7a55ca
#   path        lib/firmware/aic8800_fw/USB/aic8800D80/
#   The -9 release builds from radxa-pkg/aic8800 d13d07963cd1, the driver
#   commit this package pins; the files below are byte-identical in -11.
# Installed to /lib/firmware/aic8800_fw/USB/aic8800D80/ (the driver also
# accepts <name>.xz and <name>.zst there).
#
# Roles: required = loaded on every start of a U02/U03 chip (the A7A's, per
# the vendor image capture); optional = loaded only in the case named.
#
# name                            bytes  sha256                                                            role
fw_patch_table_8800d80_u02.bin     1384  9decb77435b7e9713e33e32da483d683b7329ed93b672b2d1b134031d7da5f67  required  aic_load_fw: Bluetooth patch table
fw_adid_8800d80_u02.bin            1708  a526cbd02fcdc495f049f3ad6b5933cb08cd984b16790c716a060d582fee1a56  required  aic_load_fw: Bluetooth ADID patch
fw_patch_8800d80_u02.bin          32700  f0e2f5bbc17bc327ca7f1574ff55370dfd863d931514347bb4abc18a74f6218f  required  aic_load_fw: Bluetooth ROM patch
fw_patch_8800d80_u02_ext0.bin     16136  ca738f5ea5aca6021c4f48b60ff35e835dfdaf072a8490e3ba8ba0a42440e3e5  required  aic_load_fw: Bluetooth extension patch 0 (named by the patch table)
fmacfw_8800d80_u02.bin           358072  23f2bed2ac0e8f7bda8f36df7defd30d9b928c97867f6f0f01f28d89dd78d670  required  aic_load_fw: Wi-Fi full-MAC firmware
fmacfw_8800d80_h_u02.bin         358640  c5c8c774dfae93aed71f8da7489e35159192135e4929591ea8a945b76deba6bd  optional  aic_load_fw: Wi-Fi firmware instead, on "H" chip variants
aic_userconfig_8800d80.txt         2724  56c039d10af63c888b18890f508968a143f034de279fd2c4ec7ee65133e3dbdb  optional  aic8800_fdrv: TX power/crystal settings text (driver defaults without it)
lmacfw_rf_8800d80_u02.bin        283846  5abae35d6718d031f93ae8287d008b6b9ee9504c47dd212239907e30c006bba8  optional  aic_load_fw: RF test firmware, testmode=1 only
fw_ble_scan_ad_filter.bin        371284  9cc0dde69252c2f9ed281195a638878991cc54d88c86bbbbed89d64ab9fc7317  optional  aic_load_fw: BLE scan wake-up firmware, testmode=5 only
